When suggesting API contract changes, consider:
- Standard error envelope (code, message, details, request_id)
- Consistent pagination (cursor-based preferred)
- Rate limiting headers and 429 behavior
- ETag/If-None-Match for heavy GETs
- Idempotency-Key for POST/PUT/PATCH
- Token strategy: prefer httpOnly cookies for web if feasible; Bearer for iOS; CSRF mitigation if cookies used
